WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.428 --> 00:00:03.951
Unit seventeen. My Best Friend!

2
00:00:05.083 --> 00:00:10.533
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English!

3
00:00:10.583 --> 00:00:13.888
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.938 --> 00:00:17.476
Today we learn: My Best Friend. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.705 --> 00:00:22.371
Best friend. Say it with me. Best friend!

6
00:00:25.841 --> 00:00:29.241
Trust. Say it with me. Trust!

7
00:00:32.783 --> 00:00:36.100
Loyal. Say it with me. Loyal!

8
00:00:39.561 --> 00:00:42.861
Support. Say it with me. Support!

9
00:00:46.385 --> 00:00:49.852
Honest. Say it with me. Honest!

10
00:00:53.318 --> 00:00:56.651
Share. Say it with me. Share!

11
00:01:00.173 --> 00:01:04.190
Understand. Say it with me. Understand!

12
00:01:07.648 --> 00:01:10.948
Close. Say it with me. Close!

13
00:01:14.484 --> 00:01:24.499
Grammar time! Present simple for habits. Listen. My best friend always supports me. We share everything.

14
00:01:24.549 --> 00:01:30.999
Your turn. Say it with me. My best friend always supports me. We share everything.

15
00:01:36.118 --> 00:01:45.447
My best friend and I trust each other completely. We are loyal and always support one another. We share our secrets and problems because we are honest and close.

16
00:01:45.497 --> 00:01:46.767
I like this story!

17
00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:53.337
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:53.387 --> 00:01:54.537
Loyal!

19
00:01:55.400 --> 00:02:00.493
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:00.543 --> 00:02:01.693
Understand!

21
00:02:02.848 --> 00:02:10.553
Think and answer. What makes someone a good best friend?

22
00:02:10.603 --> 00:02:11.753
Great answer!

23
00:02:12.967 --> 00:02:15.361
This unit's value is Loyalty.

24
00:02:15.411 --> 00:02:17.969
I can show loyalty every day!

25
00:02:19.106 --> 00:02:24.295
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

26
00:02:24.345 --> 00:02:26.159
Bye-bye, friends!

